        "original_id": "6949e36a-8487-5646-9dce-5a66b81fa58d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Christoph Martin Wieland, Carl Maria von Weber\n- Works: Geschichte des Agathon, Oberon, Oberon (opera)\n- Characters: Oberon\n- Concepts: Bildungsroman\n- Topics: medieval literature, Renaissance literature\n\nFacts:\n- Christoph Martin Wieland is best remembered for writing Geschichte des Agathon, which is described as the first Bildungsroman.\n- Christoph Martin Wieland also wrote the epic Oberon.\n- Carl Maria von Weber's opera Oberon was based on Christoph Martin Wieland's epic Oberon.\n- Oberon is a king of the fairies in medieval literature and Renaissance literature.",
